# SkyEye Tab Trust Audit

The `SkyEyeTabAuditor` agent (`backend/app/services/skyeye_tab_auditor.py`) tests all 58 API endpoints across the 20 SkyEye dashboard tabs 3x daily (5am/5pm/11pm UTC) and emails a trust scorecard to `support@sovereignsanctuary.net`.

